  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">GIE Katama Capacity Building Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sector: Horticulture (vegetables, papaya, and tree crops (citrus, mango)), Beneficiaries: 20 members, up to 60 seasonal laborers, The project funds will be used to enable the group to develop twelve hectares of land for improved vegetable and fruit production. The group will use a surface irrigation system which will improve their capacity to grow vegetables regardless of season.,</narrative>
  </description>
